## **6. Technical Specifications (Global)**

### **Database Interactions**
All database interactions are handled via the [supabase/client.ts](file:///c:/Users/admin/Downloads/readmart-brand-kit-main/src/integrations/supabase/client.ts) using **Row Level Security (RLS)**.
- **Anonymous**: Can read `products`, `categories`, `cms_content`.
- **Authenticated**: Can CRUD `orders`, `reviews`, `profiles` (own data only).
- **Founder/Admin**: Full bypass of RLS for all tables.

### **Shared Services & Utilities**
- **Auth Service**: `src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx` - Handles JWT, sessions, and RBAC state.
- **Currency Service**: `src/contexts/CurrencyContext.tsx` - KES/USD conversion and formatting.
- **Cart Service**: `src/contexts/CartContext.tsx` - LocalStorage persistence with DB sync.
- **Settings Hook**: `src/hooks/useSettings.ts` - Fetches global platform constants (shipping fees, logos).

